==Description==
'''Frost Spirit''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was obtained from Level 29 of the premium track, which costs {{Bell|980}} or {{Robux|88}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,840}}.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the [[Frost Spirit]] with a happy expression. It plays an icy shriek sound when used.

==Update History==
*'''16 December 2024''' - [[v1.46.0]]
**'''Frost Spirit''' added.
*'''12 February 2025''' - [[v1.52.0|v1.52.4b]]
**'''Frost Spirit''' is no longer obtainable.



